      "label": "Überblick",
      "title": "Lesson intro",
      "minutes": 40,
      "learn": [
        "Wo?: in, an or auf + dative, and bei + dative for a person.",
        "Wohin?: in, an or auf + accusative, nach for cities and countries without an article, zu + dative for a person.",
        "Woher?: aus + dative for a room or place, von + dative for a person.",
        "Fixed phrases: zu Hause, nach Hause, von zu Hause. The ward is not *nach Station."
